  Settings:
    Factions:
    - Name: Pulse Foundry
      Description: Fast arm-cannon sentries and a slowing specialist. Build all six
        regular designs to unlock the champion.
      Designs: 00000000010000000200000003000000040000000500000006000000
    - Name: Blast Circuit
      Description: Explosive attacks with steady firing speed. Build all six regular
        designs to unlock the champion.
      Designs: 0700000008000000090000000a0000000b0000000c0000000d000000
    - Name: Prism Division
      Description: Balanced precision weapons and chained energy. Build all six regular
        designs to unlock the champion.
      Designs: 0e0000000f0000001000000011000000120000001300000014000000
    - Name: Horizon Guild
      Description: Long-range specialists cover wide approaches. Build all six regular
        designs to unlock the champion.
      Designs: 15000000160000001700000018000000190000001a0000001b000000
    - Name: Gravity Works
      Description: Costly specialists mix control and area attacks. Build all six
        regular designs to unlock the champion.
      Designs: 1c0000001d0000001e0000001f000000200000002100000022000000
    - Name: Scrap Frontier
      Description: The cheapest armed maze pieces and adaptable support. Build all
        six regular designs to unlock the champion.
      Designs: 23000000240000002500000026000000270000002800000029000000
    - Name: Overdrive Order
      Description: Heavy damage trades away range and firing speed. Build all six
        regular designs to unlock the champion.
      Designs: 2a0000002b0000002c0000002d0000002e0000002f00000030000000
    - Name: Tidal Array
      Description: A versatile collection of splash, control and precision. Build
        all six regular designs to unlock the champion.
      Designs: 31000000320000003300000034000000350000003600000037000000
